    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300cAction games are so fun, aren't they?\u300d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful world,<br>a deep story,<br>imaginative flavor text...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...Instead of all that,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made this game so even people who don\u2019t usually play action games can feel that it\u2019s <i>fun</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special moves of the main character:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Glide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spread your wings and glide. The floaty feeling of flying far might get you hooked?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/e9c2c88bf157cf9ca436a6155bb9525a.poster.avif?t=1755687650\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/e9c2c88bf157cf9ca436a6155bb9525a.webm?t=1755687650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/e9c2c88bf157cf9ca436a6155bb9525a.mp4?t=1755687650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Super Dash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you keep running on the ground, the faster you go. It makes the glide even more powerful\u2014guaranteed to feel great.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/99c3f468e4cda2381e644f5ea8ec8e2e.poster.avif?t=1755687650\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/99c3f468e4cda2381e644f5ea8ec8e2e.webm?t=1755687650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/99c3f468e4cda2381e644f5ea8ec8e2e.mp4?t=1755687650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Wall Bounce Glide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use walls, one of the obstacles, to your advantage. It\u2019s tricky, but if you can pull it off... it\u2019s a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/7b49fa18ec5ab52055261d4dbea7c1b3.poster.avif?t=1755687650\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/7b49fa18ec5ab52055261d4dbea7c1b3.webm?t=1755687650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/7b49fa18ec5ab52055261d4dbea7c1b3.mp4?t=1755687650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300cAction games are so fun, aren't they?\u300d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful world,<br>a deep story,<br>imaginative flavor text...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...Instead of all that,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made this game so even people who don\u2019t usually play action games can feel that it\u2019s <i>fun</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special moves of the main character:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Glide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spread your wings and glide. The floaty feeling of flying far might get you hooked?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/e9c2c88bf157cf9ca436a6155bb9525a.poster.avif?t=1755687650\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/e9c2c88bf157cf9ca436a6155bb9525a.webm?t=1755687650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/e9c2c88bf157cf9ca436a6155bb9525a.mp4?t=1755687650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Super Dash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you keep running on the ground, the faster you go. It makes the glide even more powerful\u2014guaranteed to feel great.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/99c3f468e4cda2381e644f5ea8ec8e2e.poster.avif?t=1755687650\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/99c3f468e4cda2381e644f5ea8ec8e2e.webm?t=1755687650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/99c3f468e4cda2381e644f5ea8ec8e2e.mp4?t=1755687650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Wall Bounce Glide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use walls, one of the obstacles, to your advantage. It\u2019s tricky, but if you can pull it off... it\u2019s a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/7b49fa18ec5ab52055261d4dbea7c1b3.poster.avif?t=1755687650\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/7b49fa18ec5ab52055261d4dbea7c1b3.webm?t=1755687650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/7b49fa18ec5ab52055261d4dbea7c1b3.mp4?t=1755687650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
